RadGuard is an independent Rust implementation of the design and behavior of the
DAD (Dalvik Analysis Decompiler) engine from Androguard
(https://github.com/androguard/androguard, Copyright 2015-2026 The Androguard
Project, Apache License 2.0). It does not invoke Androguard or Python at runtime.
The decompiled output is reconstructed pseudocode, not original Java source.

This copy is rxd's maintained fork; see FORK.md for the changes relative to
upstream (https://github.com/MG1937/radguard).
